{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018q4SxFtpnonXrFNc1WGF5U","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-03\",\n3\t  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-19T14:05:00Z\",\n4\t  \"phase\": \"intake\",\n5\t  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n6\t\n7\t  \"functionalRequirements\": [\n8\t    { \"id\": \"FR-1\",  \"description\": \"Data model: StudentProfile, TeacherProfile, ParentProfile and ParentStudentLink models (plus Gender and GuardianRelationship enums) with relations added from User to each profile and to ParentStudentLink as parent and as student.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-1 Data model\" },\n9\t    { \"id\": \"FR-2\",  \"description\": \"User list (/admin/users) DataTable columns: avatar + full name, email, role chip, status chip (Invited=warning, Active=success, Disabled=default, Archived=outlined), grade level (students), last sign-in, actions menu.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-2 User list, item 1\" },\n10\t    { \"id\": \"FR-3\",  \"description\": \"User list filters: role (multi-select), status, grade level (shown when role filter includes Student), search by name/email/admission number/employee number; archived users hidden unless 'Show archived' is checked.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-2 User list, item 2\" },\n11\t    { \"id\": \"FR-4\",  \"description\": \"User list row actions: View, Edit, Resend invitation (status Invited), Unlock (when lockedUntil > now), Disable/Enable, Archive/Restore.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-2 User list, item 3\" },\n12\t    { \"id\": \"FR-5\",  \"description\": \"User list bulk actions on selected rows: Resend invitations, Disable, Export CSV.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-2 User list, item 4\" },\n13\t    { \"id\": \"FR-6\",  \"description\": \"Create/edit user form is an MUI Stepper: step 1 selects role, step 2 shows common fields (first/last name, email, phone) plus role-specific fields for Student, Teacher and Parent (including inline linking/creation of family members).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-3 Create/edit user, item 1\" },\n14\t    { \"id\": \"FR-7\",  \"description\": \"Checkbox 'Send invitation email now' (default checked) calls sendInvite on user creation.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-3 Create/edit user, item 2\" },\n15\t    { \"id\": \"FR-8\",  \"description\": \"Email changes on an existing user require a confirmation dialog and invalidate pending invite tokens.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-3 Create/edit user, item 3\" },\n16\t    { \"id\": \"FR-9\",  \"description\": \"Role cannot be changed after user creation; the edit form shows it read-only.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-3 Create/edit user, item 4\" },\n17\t    { \"id\": \"FR-10\", \"description\": \"Validation: student date of birth must make them between 3 and 21 years old; phone must match the pattern ^\\\\+?[0-9 ()-]{7,20}$.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-3 Create/edit user, item 5\" },\n18\t    { \"id\": \"FR-11\", \"description\": \"User detail page (/admin/users/[id]) shows profile data, status, last sign-in, linked family members (with links), and the 20 most recent audit entries where the user is actor or entity.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-4 User detail, item 1\" },\n19\t    { \"id\": \"FR-12\", \"description\": \"Disable sets status=DISABLED; the PRD-01 session check is extended so the user's sessions stop working within 5 minutes.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-5 Status changes, item 1\" },\n20\t    { \"id\": \"FR-13\", \"description\": \"Archive sets archivedAt=now and status=DISABLED; archived users are excluded from all pickers app-wide but their historical records remain visible.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-5 Status changes, item 2\" },\n21\t    { \"id\": \"FR-14\", \"description\": \"An admin cannot disable or archive their own account, and the last active admin cannot be disabled, erroring with 'At least one active admin is required.'\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-5 Status changes, item 3\" },\n22\t    { \"id\": \"FR-15\", \"description\": \"Parent-student links are managed from either the student or parent form, and from a 'Family' card on the student detail page.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-6 Parent-student links, item 1\" },\n23\t    { \"id\": \"FR-16\", \"description\": \"A student can have at most 4 linked parents; exactly one link per student may be isPrimary (setting one clears the others).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-6 Parent-student links, item 2\" },\n24\t    { \"id\": \"FR-17\", \"description\": \"src/server/auth/student-access.ts exports getAccessibleStudentIds(user) (role-based accessible student id resolution, returning [] for TEACHER until PRD-05) and assertCanViewStudent(user, studentId) (throws FORBIDDEN or NOT_FOUND for parents/students to avoid revealing existence).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-6 Parent-student links, item 3\" },\n25\t    { \"id\": \"FR-18\", \"description\": \"CSV import page (/admin/users/import) provides downloadable students-template.csv and teachers-template.csv with the specified column headers.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-7 CSV import, item 1\" },\n26\t    { \"id\": \"FR-19\", \"description\": \"CSV upload (max 2 MB, max 2,000 rows) is parsed in the browser with papaparse into a preview DataGrid marking each row Valid, Warning or Error with a per-cell reason.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-7 CSV import, item 2\" },\n27\t    { \"id\": \"FR-20\", \"description\": \"'Import N valid rows' sends rows to POST /api/users/import in batches of 200; the server re-validates every row, creates users and links in one transaction per batch, and returns per-row results.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-7 CSV import, item 3\" },\n28\t    { \"id\": \"FR-21\", \"description\": \"Import option 'Send invitations after import' (default off); grade levels matched by name or shortName case-insensitively; dates accepted only as YYYY-MM-DD.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-7 CSV import, item 4\" },\n29\t    { \"id\": \"FR-22\", \"description\": \"After import, show a summary (created students, created parents, linked existing parents, failed rows) and a 'Download error report' CSV listing failed rows with reasons.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-7 CSV import, item 5\" },\n30\t    { \"id\": \"FR-23\", \"description\": \"Re-importing the same file creates no duplicates: rows whose email already exists are reported as 'Skipped — already exists'.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-7 CSV import, item 6\" },\n31\t    { \"id\": \"FR-24\", \"description\": \"Student detail page (/students/[studentId]) header shows avatar, name, admission number, grade level, status; this PRD registers an 'Overview' tab (profile, family, emergency contact; medical notes only for ADMIN and TEACHER) in src/config/student-tabs.ts.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-8 Student detail page, item 1\" },\n32\t    { \"id\": \"FR-25\", \"description\": \"Student detail page access is gated through assertCanViewStudent.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-8 Student detail page, item 2\" },\n33\t    { \"id\": \"FR-26\", \"description\": \"Parent 'My children' page (/my-children, PARENT only) lists linked children as cards (name, grade level, admission number) linking to /students/[id], with an empty state when none are linked.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-9 Parent 'My children'\" },\n34\t    { \"id\": \"FR-27\", \"description\": \"Self-service profile page (/account/profile): any user sees their own name/email/role (read-only) and can edit phone, plus occupation and address for parents; a 'Profile' entry is added to the user menu.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-10 Profile\" },\n35\t    { \"id\": \"FR-28\", \"description\": \"GET /api/users/search?role=&q= returns up to 20 {id, name, email, role} matches excluding archived users (ADMIN/TEACHER only), consumed by a reusable UserPicker component built on MUI Autocomplete (async options, multiple support, avatar+name+role renderOption).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-11 Directory pickers\" },\n36\t    { \"id\": \"FR-29\", \"description\": \"Audit log viewer (/admin/audit-log): read-only table of time, actor, action, entity type, entity id (linked when a user), IP, with filters for actor, action prefix and date range; a row click opens a right-anchored Drawer with pretty-printed metadata JSON.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-12 Audit log viewer\" },\n37\t    { \"id\": \"FR-30\", \"description\": \"Navigation: Administration group gains Users, Import users and Audit log entries; Parents get 'My children'; all users get 'Profile' in the user menu.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-13 Navigation\" },\n38\t    { \"id\": \"FR-31\", \"description\": \"POST /api/users/:id/unlock clears the lockout fields (lockedUntil/failedLoginCount) set by the PRD-01 lockout mechanism, restoring sign-in access immediately.\", \"confidence\": \"MEDIUM\", \"source\": \"API table, 'POST /api/users/:id/unlock' row — behaviour inferred from the PRD-01 lockout fields this PRD's row action operates on\" }\n39\t  ],\n40\t\n41\t  \"nonFunctionalRequirements\": [\n42\t    { \"id\": \"NFR-1\", \"description\": \"Privacy: medicalNotes must never be returned to STUDENT or PARENT roles (enforced in the service layer, stripped from GET /api/students/:id for those roles) and must be excluded from exported CSVs.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Non-Functional Requirements, item 1 (Privacy)\" },\n43\t    { \"id\": \"NFR-2\", \"description\": \"Performance: the user list must return a page in under 300 ms with 5,000 users, backed by an index on lastName, firstName, email.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Non-Functional Requirements, item 2 (Performance)\" },\n44\t    { \"id\": \"NFR-3\", \"description\": \"Reliability: an import batch either fully succeeds or fully rolls back; partial batches never persist.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Non-Functional Requirements, item 3 (Reliability)\" },\n45\t    { \"id\": \"NFR-4\", \"description\": \"Security: CSV export must neutralise formula injection by prefixing cells starting with =, +, -, @ with a leading apostrophe.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Non-Functional Requirements, item 4 (Security)\" },\n46\t    { \"id\": \"NFR-5\", \"description\": \"Every visible element in this PRD is built from Material UI (@mui/material, @mui/icons-material, MUI X data-grid/date-pickers) only, looked up through the MUI MCP server before use; the platform's banned UI/styling library list (Tailwind, shadcn/ui, Chakra, Ant Design, react-select, react-datepicker, etc.) is enforced by ESLint no-restricted-imports.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"UI component rule (mandatory), items 1-6\" },\n47\t    { \"id\": \"NFR-6\", \"description\": \"Test coverage: Vitest unit tests for the CSV row validator, admission-number generator, formula-injection escaping and getAccessibleStudentIds per role; Vitest integration tests for import batch rollback, the last-admin guard and primary-link uniqueness; Playwright e2e for create-student-with-parent, CSV import happy path with an error row, and parent My-children → student page.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Test Requirements\" },\n48\t    { \"id\": \"NFR-7\", \"description\": \"Brownfield discipline: reuse existing PRD-00/01/02 models, services, components and helpers; never re-scaffold the project, duplicate an existing helper, or rename an existing route or model.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Platform Context, paragraph 1\" },\n49\t    { \"id\": \"NFR-8\", \"description\": \"Delivery discipline: keep npm run lint/typecheck/test passing, add only the tests listed in this PRD, do not expand scope beyond this PRD's sections, and do not modify behaviour owned by later PRDs (e.g. class/section membership is PRD-05's).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Assumptions and constraints, Constraints\" }\n50\t  ],\n51\t\n52\t  \"overallConfidencePct\": 97,\n53\t  \"clarificationLog\": [],\n54\t  \"status\": \"complete\"\n55\t}\n56\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2a933411-2428-4c0f-ab5f-3414109df7d8","uuid":"b90937b9-3b19-4c25-a2e9-884d05d03ebc","timestamp":"2026-10-19T09:10:13.514Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub-prds/artifacts/intake/requirements.json","content":"{\n  \"ticketId\": \"abcd-03\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-19T14:05:00Z\",\n  \"phase\": \"intake\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0\",\n\n  \"functionalRequirements\": [\n    { \"id\": \"FR-1\",  \"description\": \"Data model: StudentProfile, TeacherProfile, ParentProfile and ParentStudentLink models (plus Gender and GuardianRelationship enums) with relations added from User to each profile and to ParentStudentLink as parent and as student.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-1 Data model\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-2\",  \"description\": \"User list (/admin/users) DataTable columns: avatar + full name, email, role chip, status chip (Invited=warning, Active=success, Disabled=default, Archived=outlined), grade level (students), last sign-in, actions menu.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-2 User list, item 1\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-3\",  \"description\": \"User list filters: role (multi-select), status, grade level (shown when role filter includes Student), search by name/email/admission number/employee number; archived users hidden unless 'Show archived' is checked.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-2 User list, item 2\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-4\",  \"description\": \"User list row actions: View, Edit, Resend invitation (status Invited), Unlock (when lockedUntil > now), Disable/Enable, Archive/Restore.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-2 User list, item 3\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-5\",  \"description\": \"User list bulk actions on selected rows: Resend invitations, Disable, Export CSV.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-2 User list, item 4\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-6\",  \"description\": \"Create/edit user form is an MUI Stepper: step 1 selects role, step 2 shows common fields (first/last name, email, phone) plus role-specific fields for Student, Teacher and Parent (including inline linking/creation of family members).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-3 Create/edit user, item 1\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-7\",  \"description\": \"Checkbox 'Send invitation email now' (default checked) calls sendInvite on user creation.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-3 Create/edit user, item 2\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-8\",  \"description\": \"Email changes on an existing user require a confirmation dialog and invalidate pending invite tokens.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-3 Create/edit user, item 3\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-9\",  \"description\": \"Role cannot be changed after user creation; the edit form shows it read-only.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-3 Create/edit user, item 4\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-10\", \"description\": \"Validation: student date of birth must make them between 3 and 21 years old; phone must match the pattern ^\\\\+?[0-9 ()-]{7,20}$.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-3 Create/edit user, item 5\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-11\", \"description\": \"User detail page (/admin/users/[id]) shows profile data, status, last sign-in, linked family members (with links), and the 20 most recent audit entries where the user is actor or entity.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-4 User detail, item 1\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-12\", \"description\": \"Disable sets status=DISABLED; the PRD-01 session check is extended so the user's sessions stop working within 5 minutes.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-5 Status changes, item 1\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-13\", \"description\": \"Archive sets archivedAt=now and status=DISABLED; archived users are excluded from all pickers app-wide but their historical records remain visible.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-5 Status changes, item 2\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-14\", \"description\": \"An admin cannot disable or archive their own account, and the last active admin cannot be disabled, erroring with 'At least one active admin is required.'\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-5 Status changes, item 3\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-15\", \"description\": \"Parent-student links are managed from either the student or parent form, and from a 'Family' card on the student detail page.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-6 Parent-student links, item 1\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-16\", \"description\": \"A student can have at most 4 linked parents; exactly one link per student may be isPrimary (setting one clears the others).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-6 Parent-student links, item 2\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-17\", \"description\": \"src/server/auth/student-access.ts exports getAccessibleStudentIds(user) (role-based accessible student id resolution, returning [] for TEACHER until PRD-05) and assertCanViewStudent(user, studentId) (throws FORBIDDEN or NOT_FOUND for parents/students to avoid revealing existence).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-6 Parent-student links, item 3\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-18\", \"description\": \"CSV import page (/admin/users/import) provides downloadable students-template.csv and teachers-template.csv with the specified column headers.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-7 CSV import, item 1\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-19\", \"description\": \"CSV upload (max 2 MB, max 2,000 rows) is parsed in the browser with papaparse into a preview DataGrid marking each row Valid, Warning or Error with a per-cell reason.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-7 CSV import, item 2\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-20\", \"description\": \"'Import N valid rows' sends rows to POST /api/users/import in batches of 200; the server re-validates every row, creates users and links in one transaction per batch, and returns per-row results.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-7 CSV import, item 3\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-21\", \"description\": \"Import option 'Send invitations after import' (default off); grade levels matched by name or shortName case-insensitively; dates accepted only as YYYY-MM-DD.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-7 CSV import, item 4\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-22\", \"description\": \"After import, show a summary (created students, created parents, linked existing parents, failed rows) and a 'Download error report' CSV listing failed rows with reasons.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-7 CSV import, item 5\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-23\", \"description\": \"Re-importing the same file creates no duplicates: rows whose email already exists are reported as 'Skipped — already exists'.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-7 CSV import, item 6\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-24\", \"description\": \"Student detail page (/students/[studentId]) header shows avatar, name, admission number, grade level, status; this PRD registers an 'Overview' tab (profile, family, emergency contact; medical notes only for ADMIN and TEACHER) in src/config/student-tabs.ts.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-8 Student detail page, item 1\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-25\", \"description\": \"Student detail page access is gated through assertCanViewStudent.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-8 Student detail page, item 2\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-26\", \"description\": \"Parent 'My children' page (/my-children, PARENT only) lists linked children as cards (name, grade level, admission number) linking to /students/[id], with an empty state when none are linked.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-9 Parent 'My children'\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-27\", \"description\": \"Self-service profile page (/account/profile): any user sees their own name/email/role (read-only) and can edit phone, plus occupation and address for parents; a 'Profile' entry is added to the user menu.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-10 Profile\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-28\", \"description\": \"GET /api/users/search?role=&q= returns up to 20 {id, name, email, role} matches excluding archived users (ADMIN/TEACHER only), consumed by a reusable UserPicker component built on MUI Autocomplete (async options, multiple support, avatar+name+role renderOption).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-11 Directory pickers\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-29\", \"description\": \"Audit log viewer (/admin/audit-log): read-only table of time, actor, action, entity type, entity id (linked when a user), IP, with filters for actor, action prefix and date range; a row click opens a right-anchored Drawer with pretty-printed metadata JSON.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-12 Audit log viewer\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-30\", \"description\": \"Navigation: Administration group gains Users, Import users and Audit log entries; Parents get 'My children'; all users get 'Profile' in the user menu.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"FR-13 Navigation\" },\n    { \"id\": \"FR-31\", \"description\": \"POST /api/users/:id/unlock clears the lockout fields (lockedUntil/failedLoginCount) set by the PRD-01 lockout mechanism, restoring sign-in access immediately.\", \"confidence\": \"MEDIUM\", \"source\": \"API table, 'POST /api/users/:id/unlock' row — behaviour inferred from the PRD-01 lockout fields this PRD's row action operates on\" }\n  ],\n\n  \"nonFunctionalRequirements\": [\n    { \"id\": \"NFR-1\", \"description\": \"Privacy: medicalNotes must never be returned to STUDENT or PARENT roles (enforced in the service layer, stripped from GET /api/students/:id for those roles) and must be excluded from exported CSVs.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Non-Functional Requirements, item 1 (Privacy)\" },\n    { \"id\": \"NFR-2\", \"description\": \"Performance: the user list must return a page in under 300 ms with 5,000 users, backed by an index on lastName, firstName, email.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Non-Functional Requirements, item 2 (Performance)\" },\n    { \"id\": \"NFR-3\", \"description\": \"Reliability: an import batch either fully succeeds or fully rolls back; partial batches never persist.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Non-Functional Requirements, item 3 (Reliability)\" },\n    { \"id\": \"NFR-4\", \"description\": \"Security: CSV export must neutralise formula injection by prefixing cells starting with =, +, -, @ with a leading apostrophe.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Non-Functional Requirements, item 4 (Security)\" },\n    { \"id\": \"NFR-5\", \"description\": \"Every visible element in this PRD is built from Material UI (@mui/material, @mui/icons-material, MUI X data-grid/date-pickers) only, looked up through the MUI MCP server before use; the platform's banned UI/styling library list (Tailwind, shadcn/ui, Chakra, Ant Design, react-select, react-datepicker, etc.) is enforced by ESLint no-restricted-imports.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"UI component rule (mandatory), items 1-6\" },\n    { \"id\": \"NFR-6\", \"description\": \"Test coverage: Vitest unit tests for the CSV row validator, admission-number generator, formula-injection escaping and getAccessibleStudentIds per role; Vitest integration tests for import batch rollback, the last-admin guard and primary-link uniqueness; Playwright e2e for create-student-with-parent, CSV import happy path with an error row, and parent My-children → student page.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Test Requirements\" },\n    { \"id\": \"NFR-7\", \"description\": \"Brownfield discipline: reuse existing PRD-00/01/02 models, services, components and helpers; never re-scaffold the project, duplicate an existing helper, or rename an existing route or model.\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Platform Context, paragraph 1\" },\n    { \"id\": \"NFR-8\", \"description\": \"Delivery discipline: keep npm run lint/typecheck/test passing, add only the tests listed in this PRD, do not expand scope beyond this PRD's sections, and do not modify behaviour owned by later PRDs (e.g. class/section membership is PRD-05's).\", \"confidence\": \"HIGH\", \"source\": \"Assumptions and constraints, Constraints\" }\n  ],\n\n  \"overallConfidencePct\": 97,\n  \"clarificationLog\": [],\n  \"status\": \"complete\"\n}\n","numLines":56,"startLine":1,"totalLines":56}}}
