 admin-only `GET /api/timetable/free-rooms` endpoint.\n- **Clash preview while dragging (FR-36):** the availability endpoint takes an optional `roomId`. The client passes the room the drop will actually use, so the red cells match what the server will check.\n- **Turning off a teaching day:** the slot count shown and the slots deleted both cover all academic years, so the number in the confirm dialog is the number removed.\n- **Archived courses and rooms:** they're hidden from the sidebar and pickers but still count in clash checks. Writing a slot for one is rejected with a 400.\n- **Admin on `/api/me/timetable`:** returns an empty list rather than an error.\n- **Retry on serialization failures:** a small wrapper kept inside `timetable-service.ts`, since nothing else needs it yet.\n- **Audit (FR-40):** confirmed for slot, period and school-day changes. `audit()` doesn't take a transaction, so it runs after the commit and a rolled-back write is never logged.\n- **Teacher access to section views:** homeroom sections plus sections of courses they teach.\n\n**Structure:** the clash rules go in one pure file, `src/server/timetable/clash-rules.ts`, which the unit tests and the availability map both use. Saving a slot uses the serializable transaction with retry, and the grid only updates after the server accepts the change, so a rejected drop snaps back with no undo code. A test checks that the seeded week has no clashes.\n\n**Intake blockers:**\n- The seed fixtures and the ELA/SOC subject defaults are accepted.\n- The free-rooms and slot-count questions are settled by the decisions above.\n- The mui-mcp lookup stays a hard requirement for the dev phase.\n\n`api-contracts.json` and `handoff-to-dev-planning.json` are still the SH-4 versions. The `arch-api-contracts` sub-task overwrites them next.","ttft_ms":3143,"type":"result","duration_ms":174840,"uuid":"1199af0c-7c06-44b1-b484-c5c60f393541","ttft_stream_ms":2179,"time_to_request_ms":90,"first_content_frame_ms":2179,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":18,"outputTokens":18920,"cacheReadInputTokens":441672,"cacheCreationInputTokens":63711,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.9764944,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":856,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":63711,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}}}
