{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0195gkFfDXUCm46zVUK2VPRg","type":"tool_result","content":"total 152\ndrwxr-xr-x   8 ikramaansari  staff    256 Nov  6 10:32 .\ndrwxr-xr-x  11 ikramaansari  staff    352 Nov  5 11:37 ..\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  15692 Nov  5 21:31 api-contracts.json\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff   1506 Nov  5 21:31 handoff-to-dev-planning.json\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  14193 Nov  6 10:32 requirements-analysis-notes.md\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  17451 Nov  5 21:30 system-design.md\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff  13317 Nov  6 10:32 tech-stack-decisions.md\n-rw-r--r--   1 ikramaansari  staff    374 Nov  5 21:31 threat-model-notes.json\n# System Design — SH-1 · PRD-01 Authentication, Sessions & RBAC (SCH-001)\n\nTicket: SH-1 · Phase: architect (arch-design-system) · Timestamp: 2026-11-05T17:30:00Z · Status: complete\nInputs: `artifacts/intake/requirements.json` (re-run 2026-11-05T16:26:09Z; 34 FR + 15 NFR, 97%),\n`handoff-to-architect.json` (5 blockers), `tech-stack-decisions.md` (ADR-1…ADR-5) and\n`requirements-analysis-notes.md` (B1…B14). Run mode: `--brownfield --tech-stack react`.\n\n> This file replaces the earlier SH-1 design (11:41). That version planned the seed users, the role/status\n> migration and `/login` as new work. All three are now on disk, so they have been removed from scope.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Overview\n\nSchoolHub is a Next.js 14 App Router monolith (React 18, TypeScript strict, Prisma 5 / PostgreSQL, Auth.js v5\nCredentials + JWT, MUI 9.5). The whole PRD-01 backend already exists: models, `tokens.ts`, `credentials.ts`\n(lockout, `DUMMY_HASH`), the JWT session with its 5-minute `passwordChangedAt` recheck, middleware, the rate\nlimiter, audit, validators, services, all five API routes, `/login`, the seed and the `[role, status]` index.\n\n**This ticket covers UI gaps, shell wiring and tests.** It adds 4 pages and 3 small client forms, rewires the\n`(app)` layout and shell, and adds tests. It adds **no API endpoint, service, model, migration or dependency**\n(ADR-1, ADR-5, NFR-13).\n\n### Intake blockers (compliance rule 5)\n\n| # | Blocker (`handoff-to-architect.json`) | Resolution in this design |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | BROWNFIELD: design only the gaps. | §2.1 lists the existing modules as **reuse, do not modify**. New work is C1–C9 only. |\n| 2 | GAPS: 3 `(auth)` pages, `/account/security`, removing `PLACEHOLDER_USER` and wiring the user, badge, initials, signOut and menu item, plus integration and e2e tests. | C1–C9. |\n| 3 | REUSE: TextFormField, PasswordChecklist/passwordInputSlot, useToast, safeCallbackUrl, the existing API routes. | Every new component below is built from these. It also reuses `SetPasswordForm`, `postJson` and `applyFieldErrors` (B2). |\nartifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md:# Requirements Analysis Notes — ticket SH-7\nartifacts/architect/requirements-analysis-notes.md:> This file replaces the stale SH-1 notes that were here before.\nartifacts/architect/system-design.md:# System Design — SH-1 · PRD-01 Authentication, Sessions & RBAC (SCH-001)\nartifacts/architect/system-design.md:Ticket: SH-1 · Phase: architect (arch-design-system) · Timestamp: 2026-11-05T17:30:00Z · Status: complete\nartifacts/architect/system-design.md:> This file replaces the earlier SH-1 design (11:41). That version planned the seed users, the role/status\nartifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md:Ticket: SH-7 · Phase: architect (arch-research-stack) · Timestamp: 2026-11-06T06:00:00Z · Status: complete\nartifacts/architect/tech-stack-decisions.md:This file replaces the stale SH-1 (PRD-01) version that was in this folder.\nartifacts/architect/api-contracts.json:  \"ticketId\": \"SH-1\",\nartifacts/architect/api-contracts.json:    \"scope\": \"SH-1 adds NO new endpoints (system-design.md §1, ADR-1, NFR-13). Every contract below documents an EXISTING route that the new pages (C1–C5), shell (C7) and tests (C8, C9