ax 150 characters).\n08-course-content.md-115-4. `GET /api/files/:id` streams the file with `Content-Disposition: attachment` (inline for images and PDFs when `?inline=1`), `X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff` and the stored MIME type. Access is decided by a resolver registry `src/server/files/access.ts`: `registerFileAccess(context, (user, file) => boolean | Promise<boolean>)`. This PRD registers `lesson` (can view the lesson), `logo` (public). Unknown context → only the owner and admins. Later PRDs register their contexts.\n08-course-content.md-116-5. Unattached files (`contextId` null) older than 24 hours are deleted by `purgeOrphanFiles()`, called from the daily maintenance run started in PRD-04's dispatcher.\n08-course-content.md-117-6. A reusable `FileUpload` component built from MUI (`Paper` drop zone with dashed border, `Button component=\"label\"` with a visually hidden file input as shown in the MUI MCP \"Button\" file-upload demo, `LinearProgress` per file, `List` of files): drag-and-drop zone + button, multiple files, per-file progress bar (XHR upload progress), remove button, displays name, size and type icon. A `FileList` component shows attached files with download links.\n08-course-content.md-118-\n08-course-content.md-119-### FR-2 Content data model\n08-course-content.md-120-\n08-course-content.md-121-```prisma\n08-course-content.md:122:enum ContentStatus { DRAFT SCHEDULED PUBLISHED }\n08-course-content.md-123-\n08-course-content.md-124-model Module {\n08-course-content.md-125-  id          String        @id @default(cuid())\n08-course-content.md-126-  courseId    String\n08-course-content.md-127-  course      Course        @relation(fields: [courseId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n08-course-content.md-128-  title       String                       // max 120\n08-course-content.md-129-  description String?\n08-course-content.md-130-  order       Int\n08-course-content.md-131-  status      ContentStatus @default(DRAFT)\n08-course-content.md-132