for real-browser loading is out of scope; the end-to-end test bypasses CSP instead.\n- The student Assignments tab works by direct URL but won't show up, because student pages have no tab bar yet.\n- The dev phase can't start UI work unless mui-mcp is reachable.\n\n`api-contracts.json` and `handoff-to-dev-planning.json` are still from SH-7. I didn't touch them; the `arch-api-contracts` sub-task overwrites them.","ttft_ms":1198,"type":"result","duration_ms":171505,"uuid":"71ff5c4a-3315-4d97-aebe-317290f5989e","ttft_stream_ms":882,"time_to_request_ms":115,"first_content_frame_ms":882,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":18,"outputTokens":19752,"cacheReadInputTokens":456351,"cacheCreationInputTokens":74385,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.0814621999999998,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":892,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":74385,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}}}
