{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GkghZ2HSXmMvRYHWF1ycWX","type":"tool_result","content":"49:- IDs are `cuid()` strings. Every model has `createdAt` and `updatedAt`. Timestamps are stored in UTC and displayed in the school timezone from `SchoolSettings.timezone`. Date-only values use `@db.Date`.\n93:### FR-1 Data model\n96:enum QuizStatus { DRAFT PUBLISHED CLOSED }\n97:enum QuestionType { SINGLE_CHOICE MULTIPLE_CHOICE TRUE_FALSE SHORT_ANSWER ESSAY }\n98:enum ResultsVisibility { IMMEDIATELY AFTER_CLOSE MANUAL }\n99:enum AttemptStatus { IN_PROGRESS SUBMITTED NEEDS_GRADING GRADED }\n100:enum ScoringPolicy { HIGHEST LATEST AVERAGE }\n102:model Quiz {\n103:  id                 String            @id @default(cuid())\n104:  courseId           String\n106:  title              String\n107:  instructions       String            @default(\"\")   // Markdown\n108:  isPractice         Boolean           @default(false) // practice quizzes never reach the gradebook\n109:  availableFrom      DateTime\n110:  availableUntil     DateTime                          // > availableFrom\n111:  timeLimitMinutes   Int?                              // 1–300, null = untimed\n112:  maxAttempts        Int               @default(1)     // 1–10\n114:  shuffleQuestions   Boolean           @default(false)\n115:  shuffleOptions     Boolean           @default(false)\n116:  oneQuestionPerPage Boolean           @default(false)\n118:  showCorrectAnswers Boolean           @default(true)  // when results are visible\n119:  resultsReleasedAt  DateTime?                         // for MANUAL\n121:  createdById        String\n122:  createdAt          DateTime          @default(now())\n123:  updatedAt          DateTime          @updatedAt\n128:model Question {\n129:  id            String       @id @default(cuid())\n130:  quizId        String\n133:  prompt        String                     // Markdown, may include an uploaded image\n134:  points        Decimal      @db.Decimal(5, 2)   // 0.5–100\n135:  order         Int\n136:  options       Json?                      // choice types: [{ id, text }]\n137:  correct       Json                       // see FR-2\n138:  explanation   String?                    // shown with correct answers\n139:  caseSensitive Boolean      @default(false)  // SHORT_ANSWER\n142:model QuizAttempt {\n143:  id             String        @id @default(cuid())\n144:  quizId         String\n146:  studentId      String\n148:  attemptNumber  Int\n150:  startedAt      DateTime      @default(now())\n151:  deadlineAt     DateTime?                  // min(startedAt + limit + extraTime, availableUntil)\n152:  submittedAt    DateTime?\n153:  autoSubmitted  Boolean       @default(false)\n154:  questionOrder  String[]                   // frozen order for this attempt\n155:  score          Decimal?      @db.Decimal(7, 2)\n156:  maxScore       Decimal       @db.Decimal(7, 2)\n161:model QuizAnswer {\n162:  attemptId     String\n164:  questionId    String\n165:  response      Json?\n166:  pointsAwarded Decimal?    @db.Decimal(5, 2)\n167:  isCorrect     Boolean?\n168:  feedback      String?\n169:  gradedById    String?\n170:  updatedAt     DateTime    @updatedAt\n174:model QuizAccommodation {\n175:  quizId           String\n176:  studentId        String\n177:  extraTimeMinutes Int      @default(0)    // 0–300\n178:  extraAttempts    Int      @default(0)    // 0–5"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e5aa5ddb-e317-4c7f-b076-47081e553974","uuid":"79626b38-2f27-4ca0-9e70-e0f0584e0a62","timestamp":"2026-11-09T07:03:47.880Z","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"49:- IDs are `cuid()` strings. Every model has `createdAt` and `updatedAt`. Timestamps are stored in UTC and displayed in the school timezone from `SchoolSettings.timezone`. Date-only values use `@db.Date`.\n93:### FR-1 Data model\n96:enum QuizStatus { DRAFT PUBLISHED CLOSED }\n97:enum QuestionType { SINGLE_CHOICE MULTIPLE_CHOICE TRUE_FALSE SHORT_ANSWER ESSAY }\n98:enum ResultsVisibility { IMMEDIATELY AFTER_CLOSE MANUAL }\n99:enum AttemptStatus { IN_PROGRESS SUBMITTED NEEDS_GRADING GRADED }\n100:enum ScoringPolicy { HIGHEST LATEST AVERAGE }\n102:model Quiz {\n103:  id                 String            @id @default(cuid())\n104:  courseId           String\n106:  title              String\n107:  instructions       String            @default(\"\")   // Markdown\n108:  isPractice         Boolean           @default(false) // practice quizzes never reach the gradebook\n109:  availableFrom      DateTime\n110:  availableUntil     DateTime                          // > availableFrom\n111:  timeLimitMinutes   Int?                              // 1–300, null = untimed\n112:  maxAttempts        Int               @default(1)     // 1–10\n114:  shuffleQuestions   Boolean           @default(false)\n115:  shuffleOptions     Boolean           @default(false)\n116:  oneQuestionPerPage Boolean           @default(false)\n118:  showCorrectAnswers Boolean           @default(true)  // when results are visible\n119:  resultsReleasedAt  DateTime?                         // for MANUAL\n121:  createdById        String\n122:  createdAt          DateTime          @default(now())\n123:  updatedAt          DateTime          @updatedAt\n128:model Question {\n129:  id            String       @id @default(cuid())\n130:  quizId        String\n133:  prompt        String                     // Markdown, may include an uploaded image\n134:  points        Decimal      @db.Decimal(5, 2)   // 0.5–100\n135:  order         Int\n136:  options       Json?                      // choice types: [{ id, text }]\n137:  correct       Json                       // see FR-2\n138:  explanation   String?                    // shown with correct answers\n139:  caseSensitive Boolean      @default(false)  // SHORT_ANSWER\n142:model QuizAttempt {\n143:  id             String        @id @default(cuid())\n144:  quizId         String\n146:  studentId      String\n148:  attemptNumber  Int\n150:  startedAt      DateTime      @default(now())\n151:  deadlineAt     DateTime?                  // min(startedAt + limit + extraTime, availableUntil)\n152:  submittedAt    DateTime?\n153:  autoSubmitted  Boolean       @default(false)\n154:  questionOrder  String[]                   // frozen order for this attempt\n155:  score          Decimal?      @db.Decimal(7, 2)\n156:  maxScore       Decimal       @db.Decimal(7, 2)\n161:model QuizAnswer {\n162:  attemptId     String\n164:  questionId    String\n165:  response      Json?\n166:  pointsAwarded Decimal?    @db.Decimal(5, 2)\n167:  isCorrect     Boolean?\n168:  feedback      String?\n169:  gradedById    String?\n170:  updatedAt     DateTime    @updatedAt\n174:model QuizAccommodation {\n175:  quizId           String\n176:  studentId        String\n177:  extraTimeMinutes Int      @default(0)    // 0–300\n178:  extraAttempts    Int      @default(0)    // 0–5","numLines":61,"totalLines":61},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01GkghZ2HSXmMvRYHWF1ycWX","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
