{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01J4V1FPweLzPM9emvdESTR8","type":"tool_result","content":"93\t### FR-1 Data model\n94\t\n95\t```prisma\n96\tenum QuizStatus { DRAFT PUBLISHED CLOSED }\n97\tenum QuestionType { SINGLE_CHOICE MULTIPLE_CHOICE TRUE_FALSE SHORT_ANSWER ESSAY }\n98\tenum ResultsVisibility { IMMEDIATELY AFTER_CLOSE MANUAL }\n99\tenum AttemptStatus { IN_PROGRESS SUBMITTED NEEDS_GRADING GRADED }\n100\tenum ScoringPolicy { HIGHEST LATEST AVERAGE }\n101\t\n102\tmodel Quiz {\n103\t  id                 String            @id @default(cuid())\n104\t  courseId           String\n105\t  course             Course            @relation(fields: [courseId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n106\t  title              String\n107\t  instructions       String            @default(\"\")   // Markdown\n108\t  isPractice         Boolean           @default(false) // practice quizzes never reach the gradebook\n109\t  availableFrom      DateTime\n110\t  availableUntil     DateTime                          // > availableFrom\n111\t  timeLimitMinutes   Int?                              // 1–300, null = untimed\n112\t  maxAttempts        Int               @default(1)     // 1–10\n113\t  scoringPolicy      ScoringPolicy     @default(HIGHEST)\n114\t  shuffleQuestions   Boolean           @default(false)\n115\t  shuffleOptions     Boolean           @default(false)\n116\t  oneQuestionPerPage Boolean           @default(false)\n117\t  resultsVisibility  ResultsVisibility @default(AFTER_CLOSE)\n118\t  showCorrectAnswers Boolean           @default(true)  // when results are visible\n119\t  resultsReleasedAt  DateTime?                         // for MANUAL\n120\t  status             QuizStatus        @default(DRAFT)\n121\t  createdById        String\n122\t  createdAt          DateTime          @default(now())\n123\t  updatedAt          DateTime          @updatedAt\n124\t  questions          Question[]\n125\t  attempts           QuizAttempt[]\n126\t}\n127\t\n128\tmodel Question {\n129\t  id            String       @id @default(cuid())\n130\t  quizId        String\n131\t  quiz          Quiz         @relation(fields: [quizId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n132\t  type          QuestionType\n133\t  prompt        String                     // Markdown, may include an uploaded image\n134\t  points        Decimal      @db.Decimal(5, 2)   // 0.5–100\n135\t  order         Int\n136\t  options       Json?                      // choice types: [{ id, text }]\n137\t  correct       Json                       // see FR-2\n138\t  explanation   String?                    // shown with correct answers\n139\t  caseSensitive Boolean      @default(false)  // SHORT_ANSWER\n140\t}\n141\t\n142\tmodel QuizAttempt {\n143\t  id             String        @id @default(cuid())\n144\t  quizId         String\n145\t  quiz           Quiz          @relation(fields: [quizId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n146\t  studentId      String\n147\t  student        User          @relation(fields: [studentId], references: [id])\n148\t  attemptNumber  Int\n149\t  status         AttemptStatus @default(IN_PROGRESS)\n150\t  startedAt      DateTime      @default(now())\n151\t  deadlineAt     DateTime?                  // min(startedAt + limit + extraTime, availableUntil)\n152\t  submittedAt    DateTime?\n153\t  autoSubmitted  Boolean       @default(false)\n154\t  questionOrder  String[]                   // frozen order for this attempt\n155\t  score          Decimal?      @db.Decimal(7, 2)\n156\t  maxScore       Decimal       @db.Decimal(7, 2)\n157\t  answers        QuizAnswer[]\n158\t  @@unique([quizId, studentId, attemptNumber])\n159\t}\n160\t\n161\tmodel QuizAnswer {\n162\t  attemptId     String\n163\t  attempt       QuizAttempt @relation(fields: [attemptId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n164\t  questionId    String\n165\t  response      Json?\n166\t  pointsAwarded Decimal?    @db.Decimal(5, 2)\n167\t  isCorrect     Boolean?\n168\t  feedback      String?\n169\t  gradedById    String?\n170\t  updatedAt     DateTime    @updatedAt\n171\t  @@id([attemptId, questionId])\n172\t}\n173\t\n174\tmodel QuizAccommodation {\n175\t  quizId           String\n176\t  studentId        String\n177\t  extraTimeMinutes Int      @default(0)    // 0–300\n178\t  extraAttempts    Int      @default(0)    // 0–5\n179\t  @@id([quizId, studentId])\n180\t}\n181\t```\n182\t\n183\t### FR-2 Question types and auto-grading (`src/server/quiz/grading.ts`)\n184\t\n185\t| Type | `options` | `correct` | `response` | Scoring |\n186\t|---|---|---|---|---|\n187\t| SINGLE_CHOICE | 2–8 options | `{ optionId }` | `{ optionId }` | full points if equal, else 0 |\n188\t| MULTIPLE_CHOICE | 2–8 options | `{ optionIds: [] }` (≥1) | `{ optionIds: [] }` | partial credit: `points × max(0, (correctSelected − incorrectSelected) / totalCorrect)` |\n189\t| TRUE_FALSE | none | `{ value: true }` | `{ value: false }` | full or 0 |\n190\t| SHORT_ANSWER | none | `{ accepted: [\"photosynthesis\", \"photo-synthesis\"] }` (1–10) | `{ text }` | full if trimmed, whitespace-collapsed text matches any accepted answer (case-insensitive unless `caseSensitive`), else 0 — teacher can override |\n191\t| ESSAY | none | `{ guidance?: \"…\" }` | `{ text }` (max 10,000) | manual |\n192\t\n193\tExample: a MULTIPLE_CHOICE worth 4 points with correct {A, C}; a student selecting {A, B} scores `4 × max(0, (1 − 1) / 2) = 0`; selecting {A} scores 2.\n194\t\n195\t### FR-3 Quiz builder (`/courses/[courseId]/quizzes/[quizId]/edit`)\n196\t1. Settings panel for every `Quiz` field with validation (availableUntil > availableFrom; time limit ≤ window length).\n197\t2. Question list with add (type picker), edit inline, duplicate, delete, drag reorder. Each type has a tailored editor: option rows with \"correct\" radio/checkbox, accepted answers list, essay guidance.\n198\t3. Running total of points; \"Preview as student\" opens the player in a non-recording preview mode.\n199\t4. Publishing validates: at least 1 question, every choice question has a correct answer, every question has points > 0.\n200\t5. After the first attempt exists, editing questions is limited: text, explanation and accepted answers may change (with a \"Regrade\" action that recomputes auto-graded answers for all attempts); adding/removing questions or changing points/type is blocked with an explanation.\n201\t\n202\t### FR-4 Course quizzes tab"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e5aa5ddb-e317-4c7f-b076-47081e553974","uuid":"ae8c0e14-73fb-4fe7-848a-6c0e8a1eb2da","timestamp":"2026-11-09T07:03:49.502Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/forge/schoolhub/10-quizzes.md","content":"### FR-1 Data model\n\n```prisma\nenum QuizStatus { DRAFT PUBLISHED CLOSED }\nenum QuestionType { SINGLE_CHOICE MULTIPLE_CHOICE TRUE_FALSE SHORT_ANSWER ESSAY }\nenum ResultsVisibility { IMMEDIATELY AFTER_CLOSE MANUAL }\nenum AttemptStatus { IN_PROGRESS SUBMITTED NEEDS_GRADING GRADED }\nenum ScoringPolicy { HIGHEST LATEST AVERAGE }\n\nmodel Quiz {\n  id                 String            @id @default(cuid())\n  courseId           String\n  course             Course            @relation(fields: [courseId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n  title              String\n  instructions       String            @default(\"\")   // Markdown\n  isPractice         Boolean           @default(false) // practice quizzes never reach the gradebook\n  availableFrom      DateTime\n  availableUntil     DateTime                          // > availableFrom\n  timeLimitMinutes   Int?                              // 1–300, null = untimed\n  maxAttempts        Int               @default(1)     // 1–10\n  scoringPolicy      ScoringPolicy     @default(HIGHEST)\n  shuffleQuestions   Boolean           @default(false)\n  shuffleOptions     Boolean           @default(false)\n  oneQuestionPerPage Boolean           @default(false)\n  resultsVisibility  ResultsVisibility @default(AFTER_CLOSE)\n  showCorrectAnswers Boolean           @default(true)  // when results are visible\n  resultsReleasedAt  DateTime?                         // for MANUAL\n  status             QuizStatus        @default(DRAFT)\n  createdById        String\n  createdAt          DateTime          @default(now())\n  updatedAt          DateTime          @updatedAt\n  questions          Question[]\n  attempts           QuizAttempt[]\n}\n\nmodel Question {\n  id            String       @id @default(cuid())\n  quizId        String\n  quiz          Quiz         @relation(fields: [quizId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n  type          QuestionType\n  prompt        String                     // Markdown, may include an uploaded image\n  points        Decimal      @db.Decimal(5, 2)   // 0.5–100\n  order         Int\n  options       Json?                      // choice types: [{ id, text }]\n  correct       Json                       // see FR-2\n  explanation   String?                    // shown with correct answers\n  caseSensitive Boolean      @default(false)  // SHORT_ANSWER\n}\n\nmodel QuizAttempt {\n  id             String        @id @default(cuid())\n  quizId         String\n  quiz           Quiz          @relation(fields: [quizId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n  studentId      String\n  student        User          @relation(fields: [studentId], references: [id])\n  attemptNumber  Int\n  status         AttemptStatus @default(IN_PROGRESS)\n  startedAt      DateTime      @default(now())\n  deadlineAt     DateTime?                  // min(startedAt + limit + extraTime, availableUntil)\n  submittedAt    DateTime?\n  autoSubmitted  Boolean       @default(false)\n  questionOrder  String[]                   // frozen order for this attempt\n  score          Decimal?      @db.Decimal(7, 2)\n  maxScore       Decimal       @db.Decimal(7, 2)\n  answers        QuizAnswer[]\n  @@unique([quizId, studentId, attemptNumber])\n}\n\nmodel QuizAnswer {\n  attemptId     String\n  attempt       QuizAttempt @relation(fields: [attemptId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n  questionId    String\n  response      Json?\n  pointsAwarded Decimal?    @db.Decimal(5, 2)\n  isCorrect     Boolean?\n  feedback      String?\n  gradedById    String?\n  updatedAt     DateTime    @updatedAt\n  @@id([attemptId, questionId])\n}\n\nmodel QuizAccommodation {\n  quizId           String\n  studentId        String\n  extraTimeMinutes Int      @default(0)    // 0–300\n  extraAttempts    Int      @default(0)    // 0–5\n  @@id([quizId, studentId])\n}\n```\n\n### FR-2 Question types and auto-grading (`src/server/quiz/grading.ts`)\n\n| Type | `options` | `correct` | `response` | Scoring |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| SINGLE_CHOICE | 2–8 options | `{ optionId }` | `{ optionId }` | full points if equal, else 0 |\n| MULTIPLE_CHOICE | 2–8 options | `{ optionIds: [] }` (≥1) | `{ optionIds: [] }` | partial credit: `points × max(0, (correctSelected − incorrectSelected) / totalCorrect)` |\n| TRUE_FALSE | none | `{ value: true }` | `{ value: false }` | full or 0 |\n| SHORT_ANSWER | none | `{ accepted: [\"photosynthesis\", \"photo-synthesis\"] }` (1–10) | `{ text }` | full if trimmed, whitespace-collapsed text matches any accepted answer (case-insensitive unless `caseSensitive`), else 0 — teacher can override |\n| ESSAY | none | `{ guidance?: \"…\" }` | `{ text }` (max 10,000) | manual |\n\nExample: a MULTIPLE_CHOICE worth 4 points with correct {A, C}; a student selecting {A, B} scores `4 × max(0, (1 − 1) / 2) = 0`; selecting {A} scores 2.\n\n### FR-3 Quiz builder (`/courses/[courseId]/quizzes/[quizId]/edit`)\n1. Settings panel for every `Quiz` field with validation (availableUntil > availableFrom; time limit ≤ window length).\n2. Question list with add (type picker), edit inline, duplicate, delete, drag reorder. Each type has a tailored editor: option rows with \"correct\" radio/checkbox, accepted answers list, essay guidance.\n3. Running total of points; \"Preview as student\" opens the player in a non-recording preview mode.\n4. Publishing validates: at least 1 question, every choice question has a correct answer, every question has points > 0.\n5. After the first attempt exists, editing questions is limited: text, explanation and accepted answers may change (with a \"Regrade\" action that recomputes auto-graded answers for all attempts); adding/removing questions or changing points/type is blocked with an explanation.\n\n### FR-4 Course quizzes tab","numLines":110,"startLine":93,"totalLines":282}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01J4V1FPweLzPM9emvdESTR8","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
