results |\n236:| `POST /api/courses/:id/grade-items` | manage | Manual items |\n237:| `PATCH /api/grade-items/:id` · `DELETE` | manage | Manual only for most fields; `isVisible` for all |\n238:| `PUT /api/grade-items/:id/grades/:studentId` | manage | `{ score?, excused?, missing?, comment? }` |\n239:| `PUT /api/courses/:id/term-overrides/:studentId` | manage | `{ termId, percent?, letter?, teacherComment? }` |\n240:| `GET /api/students/:id/grades?termId=` | view student | Only visible items |\n241:| `GET /api/report-cards?termId=&gradeLevelId=&sectionId=` | ADMIN, homeroom TEACHER | |\n242:| `POST /api/report-cards/generate` | ADMIN | `{ termId, studentIds }` |\n243:| `GET /api/report-cards/:id` | ADMIN, teachers of student, student/parents when published | |\n244:| `PATCH /api/report-cards/:id` | ADMIN, homeroom teacher (homeroom comment only) | |\n245:| `POST /api/report-cards/publish` · `/unpublish` | ADMIN | `{ ids, reason? }` |\n247:## Non-Functional Requirements\n254:## Acceptance Criteria\n266:## Test Requirements\n272:## Seed Data","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cedb5742-c42c-44c2-b06a-ff50226957e7","uuid":"de784020-a58a-4caf-ace9-d551334c22cb","timestamp":"2026-11-09T12:06:00.303Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"     277 11-gradebook.md\n1:# PRD-11: Gradebook, Grading Scales & Report Cards\n5:## Summary\n9:## Platform Context (shared by every SchoolHub PRD)\n13:### Fixed technology decisions\n32:### UI component rule (mandatory — applies to every screen in this PRD)\n41:### Code layout and conventions\n44:- `src/app/api/<feature>/…/route.ts` REST route handlers. Handlers are thin: parse with Zod → call a service → return JSON.\n49:- IDs are `cuid()` strings. Every model has `createdAt` and `updatedAt`. Timestamps are stored in UTC and displayed in the school timezone from `SchoolSettings.timezone`. Date-only values use `@db.Date`.\n56:### Roles\n60:### Assumptions and constraints\n66:## Background\n70:## Goals\n76:## Out of Scope\