{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgsKnzdLN8qPD7irvDVZR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LTtNnJd565cgjiq5VSD3n6","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/React Projects/schoolhub\" && for m in Quiz Assignment Submission Course QuizAttempt Term; do echo \"== $m\"; awk \"/^model $m \\{/,/^\\}/\" prisma/schema.prisma | grep -E \"createdById|teacherId|isLate|finalScore|returnedAt|status|availableUntil|maxScore|dueAt|archivedAt|startDate|endDate|academicYearId|resultsReleasedAt|resultsVisibility\"; done; sed -n 229,277p 11-gradebook.md; ls src/app/api | head -40; ls \"src/app/(app)\" 2>/dev/null || ls src/app","description":"Check schema fields, PRD tail and app routes"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3955,"cache_read_input_tokens":58635,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3955},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cedb5742-c42c-44c2-b06a-ff50226957e7","uuid":"d58962cf-7262-44c7-8b60-5136aaf07c83","timestamp":"2026-11-09T12:06:14.488Z","request_id":"req_011CgsKnzPhUY8enoXb7X6xY","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01LTtNnJd565cgjiq5VSD3n6":{"command":"cd \"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/React Projects/schoolhub\" && for m in Quiz Assignment Submission Course QuizAttempt Term; do echo \"== $m\"; awk \"/^model $m \\{/,/^\\}/\" prisma/schema.prisma | grep -E \"createdById|teacherId|isLate|finalScore|returnedAt|status|availableUntil|maxScore|dueAt|archivedAt|startDate|endDate|academicYearId|resultsReleasedAt|resultsVisibility\"; done; sed -n 229,277p 11-gradebook.md; ls src/app/api | head -40; ls \"src/app/(app)\" 2>/dev/null || ls src/app","description":"Check schema fields, PRD tail and app routes"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LTtNnJd565cgjiq5VSD3n6","type":"tool_result","content":"== Quiz\n  availableUntil     DateTime // > availableFrom\n  resultsVisibility  ResultsVisibility   @default(AFTER_CLOSE)\n  resultsReleasedAt  DateTime? // MANUAL release; also the AFTER_CLOSE \"notified once\" claim (A6)\n  status             QuizStatus          @default(DRAFT)\n  createdById        String\n  createdBy          User                @relation(\"QuizCreatedBy\", fields: [createdById], references: [id])\n  @@index([courseId, status])\n== Assignment\n  dueAt                    DateTime\n  status                   AssignmentStatus       @default(DRAFT)\n  archivedAt               DateTime?\n  createdById              String\n  @@index([courseId, dueAt])\n== Submission\n  status         SubmissionStatus    @default(SUBMITTED)\n  isLate         Boolean             @default(false)\n  finalScore     Decimal?            @db.Decimal(6, 2)\n  returnedAt     DateTime?\n== Course\n  academicYearId     String\n  academicYear       AcademicYear        @relation(fields: [academicYearId], references: [id])\n  teacherId          String\n  teacher            User                @relation(\"CourseTeacher\", fields: [teacherId], references: [id])\n  archivedAt         DateTime?\n  @@unique([academicYearId, code])\n== QuizAttempt\n  status        AttemptStatus @default(IN_PROGRESS)\n  deadlineAt    DateTime? // min(startedAt + limit + extraTime, availableUntil)\n  maxScore      Decimal       @db.Decimal(7, 2)\n  @@index([quizId, status])\n  @@index([status, deadlineAt])\n== Term\n  academicYearId String\n  academicYear   AcademicYear @relation(fields: [academicYearId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)\n  startDate      DateTime     @db.Date\n  endDate        DateTime     @db.Date\n  @@unique([academicYearId, name])\n  @@unique([academicYearId, order])\n## API\n\n| Method & path | Role | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| `GET/POST /api/grading-scales`, `PATCH/DELETE /api/grading-scales/:id` | GET any, write ADMIN | |\n| `GET/PUT /api/courses/:id/grade-categories` | GET view, PUT manage | PUT replaces full list, validates total 100 |\n| `GET /api/courses/:id/gradebook?termId=` | manage | Items, students, grades, computed results |\n| `POST /api/courses/:id/grade-items` | manage | Manual items |\n| `PATCH /api/grade-items/:id` · `DELETE` | manage | Manual only for most fields; `isVisible` for all |\n| `PUT /api/grade-items/:id/grades/:studentId` | manage | `{ score?, excused?, missing?, comment? }` |\n| `PUT /api/courses/:id/term-overrides/:studentId` | manage | `{ termId, percent?, letter?, teacherComment? }` |\n| `GET /api/students/:id/grades?termId=` | view student | Only visible items |\n| `GET /api/report-cards?termId=&gradeLevelId=&sectionId=` | ADMIN, homeroom TEACHER | |\n| `POST /api/report-cards/generate` | ADMIN | `{ termId, studentIds }` |\n| `GET /api/report-cards/:id` | ADMIN, teachers of student, student/parents when published | |\n| `PATCH /api/report-cards/:id` | ADMIN, homeroom teacher (homeroom comment only) | |\n| `POST /api/report-cards/publish` · `/unpublish` | ADMIN | `{ ids, reason? }` |\n\n## Non-Functional Requirements\n\n1. **Correctness:** calculation lives in pure functions with exhaustive unit tests; all arithmetic in `Decimal`.\n2. **Performance:** gradebook for 35 students × 80 items loads in under 800 ms; computing term grades for 600 students × 8 courses for report card generation finishes in under 30 seconds.\n3. **Auditability:** every manual grade change and override writes an audit entry with old and new values.\n4. **Privacy:** hidden items and unreturned scores never appear in student or parent responses.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n1. Given the FR-3.6 example, then the gradebook and the student Grades tab both show 78.0 % C+.\n2. Given Homework has `dropLowest = 1` and scores 50 %, 90 %, 100 %, then the Homework category percent excludes the 50 %.\n3. Given a returned assignment, then its score appears in the gradebook without manual entry; given a graded-but-not-returned submission, then it does not appear to the student.\n4. Given category weights totalling 90, when the teacher saves, then the save is refused with the live sum showing 90 / 100.\n5. Given an item past due marked missing, then it counts as 0; given it is excused, then it does not count.\n6. Given a letter-only override of \"B\" for Sam, then Sam's card shows the computed percent and letter B.\n7. Given an admin generates drafts for 7A and publishes them, then Sam and Pat receive a `report_card.published` notification and can open the print view; a student in 7B cannot open Sam's card.\n8. Given a published report card, when a teacher changes a grade, then the published card's snapshot does not change.\n9. Given the print view, when printed, then each student's card fits on A4 pages without the app sidebar.\n\n## Test Requirements\n\n- Unit: full calculation matrix (no categories, empty categories, drop lowest, missing vs ungraded, overrides, rounding at band edges like 89.95 → 90.0 → A).\n- Integration: sync hooks from assignment return and quiz grading; backfill idempotency; snapshot immutability.\n- Playwright: teacher edits manual grades with keyboard; admin generates and publishes report cards; parent views a report card.\n\n## Seed Data\n\n- Default scale \"Standard A–F\": A 93, A− 90, B+ 87, B 83, B− 80, C+ 77, C 73, C− 70, D+ 67, D 63, D− 60, F 0, with descriptors.\n- Categories for all 7A courses: Homework 30 %, Quizzes 30 %, Exams 40 % (drop lowest 1 homework).\n- One manual item \"Oral presentation\" in ENG-7A, graded for all students.\n- Draft report cards for 7A for Semester 1, with teacher comments for MATH and ENG.\nacademic-years\naccount\nadmin\nassignments\nattempts\nattendance\naudit-logs\nauth\ncourses\nenrollments\nfiles\ngrade-levels\nhealth\ninternal\nme\nnotifications\nperiods\nquestions\nquizzes\nrooms\nschool-days\nsections\nsettings\nstudents\nsubjects\nsubmissions\nterms\ntimetable\nusers\naccount\nadmin\nassignments\nattendance\ncourses\ndashboard\nlayout.tsx\nmy-courses\nnotifications\nquizzes\nshell.tsx\nstudents","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cedb5742-c42c-44c2-b06a-ff50226957e7","uuid":"452ef744-dd83-4074-98c1-05ba722709ad","timestamp":"2026-11-09T12:06:14.720Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"== Quiz\n  availableUntil     DateTime // > availableFrom\n  resultsVisibility  ResultsVisibility   @default(AFTER_CLOSE)\n  resultsReleasedAt  DateTime? // MANUAL release; also the AFTER_CLOSE \"notified once\" claim (A6)\n  status             QuizStatus          @default(DRAFT)\n  createdById        String\n  createdBy          User                @relation(\"QuizCreatedBy\", fields: [createdById], references: [id])\n  @@index([courseId, status])\n== Assignment\n  dueAt                    DateTime\n  status                   AssignmentStatus       @default(DRAFT)\n  archivedAt               DateTime?\n  createdById              String\n  @@index([courseId, dueAt])\n== Submission\n  status         SubmissionStatus    @default(SUBMITTED)\n  isLate         Boolean             @default(false)\n  finalScore     Decimal?            @db.Decimal(6, 2)\n  returnedAt     DateTime?\n== Course\n  academicYearId     String\n  academicYear       AcademicYear        @relation(fields: [academicYearId], references: [id])\n  teacherId          String\n  teacher            User                @relation(\"CourseTeacher\", fields: [teacherId], references: [id])\n  archivedAt         DateTime?\n  @@unique([academicYearId, code])\n== QuizAttempt\n  status        AttemptStatus @default(IN_PROGRESS)\n  deadlineAt    DateTime? // min(startedAt + limit + extraTime, availableUntil)\n  maxScore      Decimal       @db.Decimal(7, 2)\n  @@index([quizId, status])\n  @@index([status, deadlineAt])\n== Term\n  academicYearId String\n  academicYear   AcademicYear @relation(fields: [academicYearId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)\n  startDate      DateTime     @db.Date\n  endDate        DateTime     @db.Date\n  @@unique([academicYearId, name])\n  @@unique([academicYearId, order])\n## API\n\n| Method & path | Role | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| `GET/POST /api/grading-scales`, `PATCH/DELETE /api/grading-scales/:id` | GET any, write ADMIN | |\n| `GET/PUT /api/courses/:id/grade-categories` | GET view, PUT manage | PUT replaces full list, validates total 100 |\n| `GET /api/courses/:id/gradebook?termId=` | manage | Items, students, grades, computed results |\n| `POST /api/courses/:id/grade-items` | manage | Manual items |\n| `PATCH /api/grade-items/:id` · `DELETE` | manage | Manual only for most fields; `isVisible` for all |\n| `PUT /api/grade-items/:id/grades/:studentId` | manage | `{ score?, excused?, missing?, comment? }` |\n| `PUT /api/courses/:id/term-overrides/:studentId` | manage | `{ termId, percent?, letter?, teacherComment? }` |\n| `GET /api/students/:id/grades?termId=` | view student | Only visible items |\n| `GET /api/report-cards?termId=&gradeLevelId=&sectionId=` | ADMIN, homeroom TEACHER | |\n| `POST /api/report-cards/generate` | ADMIN | `{ termId, studentIds }` |\n| `GET /api/report-cards/:id` | ADMIN, teachers of student, student/parents when published | |\n| `PATCH /api/report-cards/:id` | ADMIN, homeroom teacher (homeroom comment only) | |\n| `POST /api/report-cards/publish` · `/unpublish` | ADMIN | `{ ids, reason? }` |\n\n## Non-Functional Requirements\n\n1. **Correctness:** calculation lives in pure functions with exhaustive unit tests; all arithmetic in `Decimal`.\n2. **Performance:** gradebook for 35 students × 80 items loads in under 800 ms; computing term grades for 600 students × 8 courses for report card generation finishes in under 30 seconds.\n3. **Auditability:** every manual grade change and override writes an audit entry with old and new values.\n4. **Privacy:** hidden items and unreturned scores never appear in student or parent responses.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n1. Given the FR-3.6 example, then the gradebook and the student Grades tab both show 78.0 % C+.\n2. Given Homework has `dropLowest = 1` and scores 50 %, 90 %, 100 %, then the Homework category percent excludes the 50 %.\n3. Given a returned assignment, then its score appears in the gradebook without manual entry; given a graded-but-not-returned submission, then it does not appear to the student.\n4. Given category weights totalling 90, when the teacher saves, then the save is refused with the live sum showing 90 / 100.\n5. Given an item past due marked missing, then it counts as 0; given it is excused, then it does not count.\n6. Given a letter-only override of \"B\" for Sam, then Sam's card shows the computed percent and letter B.\n7. Given an admin generates drafts for 7A and publishes them, then Sam and Pat receive a `report_card.published` notification and can open the print view; a student in 7B cannot open Sam's card.\n8. Given a published report card, when a teacher changes a grade, then the published card's snapshot does not change.\n9. Given the print view, when printed, then each student's card fits on A4 pages without the app sidebar.\n\n## Test Requirements\n\n- Unit: full calculation matrix (no categories, empty categories, drop lowest, missing vs ungraded, overrides, rounding at band edges like 89.95 → 90.0 → A).\n- Integration: sync hooks from assignment return and quiz grading; backfill idempotency; snapshot immutability.\n- Playwright: teacher edits manual grades with keyboard; admin generates and publishes report cards; parent views a report card.\n\n## Seed Data\n\n- Default scale \"Standard A–F\": A 93, A− 90, B+ 87, B 83, B− 80, C+ 77, C 73, C− 70, D+ 67, D 63, D− 60, F 0, with descriptors.\n- Categories for all 7A courses: Homework 30 %, Quizzes 30 %, Exams 40 % (drop lowest 1 homework).\n- One manual item \"Oral presentation\" in ENG-7A, graded for all students.\n- Draft report cards for 7A for Semester 1, with teacher comments for MATH and ENG.\nacademic-years\naccount\nadmin\nassignments\nattempts\nattendance\naudit-logs\nauth\ncourses\nenrollments\nfiles\ngrade-levels\nhealth\ninternal\nme\nnotifications\nperiods\nquestions\nquizzes\nrooms\nschool-days\nsections\nsettings\nstudents\nsubjects\nsubmissions\nterms\ntimetable\nusers\naccount\nadmin\nassignments\nattendance\ncourses\ndashboard\nlayout.tsx\nmy-courses\nnotifications\nquizzes\nshell.tsx\nstudents","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01LTtNnJd565cgjiq5VSD3n6","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
