{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017jXEviHJgmntonq2nNeA7F","type":"tool_result","content":"1:# PRD-12: Announcements & News\n5:## Summary\n9:## Platform Context (shared by every SchoolHub PRD)\n13:### Fixed technology decisions\n21:| Database | PostgreSQL 16 via Prisma ORM (`prisma/schema.prisma`), migrations with `prisma migrate` |\n32:### UI component rule (mandatory — applies to every screen in this PRD)\n41:### Code layout and conventions\n49:- IDs are `cuid()` strings. Every model has `createdAt` and `updatedAt`. Timestamps are stored in UTC and displayed in the school timezone from `SchoolSettings.timezone`. Date-only values use `@db.Date`.\n56:### Roles\n60:### Assumptions and constraints\n66:## Background\n70:## Goals\n76:## Out of Scope\n82:## User Stories\n90:## Functional Requirements\n92:### FR-1 Data model\n94:```prisma\n95:enum AnnouncementStatus { DRAFT SCHEDULED PUBLISHED ARCHIVED }\n96:enum AudienceType { SCHOOL STAFF ROLE GRADE_LEVEL SECTION COURSE }\n98:model Announcement {\n119:model AnnouncementAudience {\n130:model AnnouncementAttachment {\n138:model AnnouncementRead {\n148:### FR-2 Audience resolution (`src/server/announcements/audience.ts`)\n157:### FR-3 Permissions\n163:### FR-4 Composer (`/announcements/new`, `/announcements/[id]/edit`)\n168:### FR-5 Feed (`/announcements`)\n175:### FR-6 Author tools\n179:### FR-7 Notifications\n183:### FR-8 File access & public flag\n187:### FR-9 Navigation\n190:## API\n207:## Non-Functional Requirements\n213:## Acceptance Criteria\n224:## Test Requirements\n230:## Seed Data","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"59086f77-7341-496e-add0-8445c854c82b","uuid":"3fa3924f-7ef0-4e17-bf45-505715f365d6","timestamp":"2026-11-09T16:32:04.750Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"1:# PRD-12: Announcements & News\n5:## Summary\n9:## Platform Context (shared by every SchoolHub PRD)\n13:### Fixed technology decisions\n21:| Database | PostgreSQL 16 via Prisma ORM (`prisma/schema.prisma`), migrations with `prisma migrate` |\n32:### UI component rule (mandatory — applies to every screen in this PRD)\n41:### Code layout and conventions\n49:- IDs are `cuid()` strings. Every model has `createdAt` and `updatedAt`. Timestamps are stored in UTC and displayed in the school timezone from `SchoolSettings.timezone`. Date-only values use `@db.Date`.\n56:### Roles\n60:### Assumptions and constraints\n66:## Background\n70:## Goals\n76:## Out of Scope\n82:## User Stories\n90:## Functional Requirements\n92:### FR-1 Data model\n94:```prisma\n95:enum AnnouncementStatus { DRAFT SCHEDULED PUBLISHED ARCHIVED }\n96:enum AudienceType { SCHOOL STAFF ROLE GRADE_LEVEL SECTION COURSE }\n98:model Announcement {\n119:model AnnouncementAudience {\n130:model AnnouncementAttachment {\n138:model AnnouncementRead {\n148:### FR-2 Audience resolution (`src/server/announcements/audience.ts`)\n157:### FR-3 Permissions\n163:### FR-4 Composer (`/announcements/new`, `/announcements/[id]/edit`)\n168:### FR-5 Feed (`/announcements`)\n175:### FR-6 Author tools\n179:### FR-7 Notifications\n183:### FR-8 File access & public flag\n187:### FR-9 Navigation\n190:## API\n207:## Non-Functional Requirements\n213:## Acceptance Criteria\n224:## Test Requirements\n230:## Seed Data","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_017jXEviHJgmntonq2nNeA7F","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
