{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NBVf6ACURUg5ZeVLFrsMeX","type":"tool_result","content":"92\t### FR-1 Data model\n93\t\n94\t```prisma\n95\tenum AnnouncementStatus { DRAFT SCHEDULED PUBLISHED ARCHIVED }\n96\tenum AudienceType { SCHOOL STAFF ROLE GRADE_LEVEL SECTION COURSE }\n97\t\n98\tmodel Announcement {\n99\t  id                 String             @id @default(cuid())\n100\t  title              String                         // max 150\n101\t  body               String                         // Markdown, max 20,000\n102\t  authorId           String\n103\t  author             User               @relation(fields: [authorId], references: [id])\n104\t  status             AnnouncementStatus @default(DRAFT)\n105\t  publishAt          DateTime?\n106\t  expiresAt          DateTime?                      // hidden from feeds after this\n107\t  pinned             Boolean            @default(false)\n108\t  requiresAck        Boolean            @default(false)\n109\t  isPublic           Boolean            @default(false) // shown on public website news (ADMIN only)\n110\t  coverFileId        String?                         // optional cover image\n111\t  notifiedAt         DateTime?\n112\t  createdAt          DateTime           @default(now())\n113\t  updatedAt          DateTime           @updatedAt\n114\t  audiences          AnnouncementAudience[]\n115\t  attachments        AnnouncementAttachment[]\n116\t  reads              AnnouncementRead[]\n117\t}\n118\t\n119\tmodel AnnouncementAudience {\n120\t  id              String       @id @default(cuid())\n121\t  announcementId  String\n122\t  announcement    Announcement @relation(fields: [announcementId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n123\t  type            AudienceType\n124\t  refId           String?                          // gradeLevelId / sectionId / courseId; role name for ROLE\n125\t  includeStudents Boolean      @default(true)      // for GRADE_LEVEL / SECTION / COURSE\n126\t  includeParents  Boolean      @default(true)\n127\t  includeTeachers Boolean      @default(true)\n128\t}\n129\t\n130\tmodel AnnouncementAttachment {\n131\t  id              String       @id @default(cuid())\n132\t  announcementId  String\n133\t  announcement    Announcement @relation(fields: [announcementId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n134\t  fileId          String\n135\t  file            FileObject   @relation(fields: [fileId], references: [id])\n136\t}\n137\t\n138\tmodel AnnouncementRead {\n139\t  announcementId  String\n140\t  announcement    Announcement @relation(fields: [announcementId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n141\t  userId          String\n142\t  readAt          DateTime     @default(now())\n143\t  acknowledgedAt  DateTime?\n144\t  @@id([announcementId, userId])\n145\t}\n146\t```\n147\t\n148\t### FR-2 Audience resolution (`src/server/announcements/audience.ts`)\n149\t1. `resolveAudienceUserIds(audiences)` returns the deduplicated set of ACTIVE, non-archived user ids:\n150\t   - `SCHOOL`: everyone. `STAFF`: ADMIN + TEACHER. `ROLE`: users with role `refId`.\n151\t   - `GRADE_LEVEL`: students whose profile grade level is `refId` (if `includeStudents`), their linked parents (if `includeParents`), teachers of current-year courses in sections of that grade level (if `includeTeachers`).\n152\t   - `SECTION`: section members, their parents, homeroom teacher and teachers of the section's courses (same flags).\n153\t   - `COURSE`: ACTIVE enrolled students, their parents, teacher and co-teachers (same flags).\n154\t2. `isUserInAudience(user, audiences)` answers the same question for one user without loading everyone (used by feeds).\n155\t3. This service is generic and is reused by PRD-14 (calendar events).\n156\t\n157\t### FR-3 Permissions\n158\t1. ADMIN may target any audience and set `isPublic`.\n159\t2. TEACHER may target only COURSE audiences for courses they manage and SECTION audiences for the section they homeroom. `isPublic` is not available.\n160\t3. STUDENT and PARENT cannot create announcements.\n161\t4. Authors may edit their own announcements; admins may edit or archive any.\n162\t\n163\t### FR-4 Composer (`/announcements/new`, `/announcements/[id]/edit`)\n164\t1. Fields: title, body (Markdown editor from PRD-08), cover image (optional), attachments, audience builder (add one or more audience rows: type → entity picker → include students / parents / teachers checkboxes), pinned, requires acknowledgement, public (admins), publish now / schedule (`publishAt`) / save draft, expiry date.\n165\t2. Live recipient count beside the audience builder (\"Will reach 412 people: 180 students, 214 parents, 18 teachers\"), computed by `POST /api/announcements/preview-audience`.\n166\t3. Publishing a body with zero recipients is refused.\n167\t\n168\t### FR-5 Feed (`/announcements`)\n169\t1. All roles: list of published, non-expired announcements whose audience includes the user (scheduled ones appear once `publishAt <= now`, evaluated at read time). Pinned first (maximum 3 pinned shown at top), then newest. Unread items show a dot; filter tabs All / Unread / Requires acknowledgement.\n170\t2. Card: cover image thumbnail, title, author and role, date, audience chips (for example \"Grade 7 · Parents\"), excerpt (200 chars), attachment count.\n171\t3. Detail (`/announcements/[id]`): full body, attachments, \"I acknowledge\" button when required (stores `acknowledgedAt`; button becomes \"Acknowledged on 14 Sep\"). Opening records `readAt`.\n172\t4. Course tab \"Announcements\" shows announcements whose audience includes that course.\n173\t5. Parent feed labels which child each item relates to when audience is grade/section/course-scoped (\"For Sam\").\n174\t\n175\t### FR-6 Author tools\n176\t1. \"Manage\" view (`/announcements/manage`): authored (teachers) or all (admins) announcements with status, audience summary, reach, read %, acknowledged % (when required).\n177\t2. Per-announcement stats page: counts and a recipient table (name, role, read at, acknowledged at) with filters Unread / Not acknowledged, CSV export, and \"Send reminder\" which notifies only those who have not acknowledged (type `announcement.reminder`, maximum one reminder per 24 hours).\n178\t\n179\t### FR-7 Notifications\n180\t1. `announcement.published` (COMMUNICATION, default email true; `mandatoryInApp` true when `requiresAck`). Sent once when the announcement first becomes visible: immediately on publish-now; for scheduled ones by the maintenance run (`publishDueAnnouncements()` sets `notifiedAt`).\n181\t2. Email uses the `generic-notification` template with title, the first 300 characters of body as plain text and a \"Read announcement\" button.\n182\t\n183\t### FR-8 File access & public flag\n184\t1. Register file access `announcement`: users in the audience, the author, admins; plus everyone (public) when the announcement `isPublic` and published.\n185\t2. `getPublicNews({ page })` returns public, published, non-expired announcements for PRD-18.\n186\t\n187\t### FR-9 Navigation\n188\t1. \"Announcements\" for all roles (with unread count badge in the sidebar). TEACHER and ADMIN: \"New announcement\" button on the feed.\n189\t\n190\t## API\n191\t\n192\t| Method & path | Role | Notes |\n193\t|---|---|---|\n194\t| `GET /api/announcements?tab=&courseId=&page=` | any | Feed for current user |\n195\t| `GET /api/announcements/unread-count` | any | |\n196\t| `GET /api/announcements/:id` | in audience, author, ADMIN | Marks read |\n197\t| `POST /api/announcements` | ADMIN, TEACHER | Audience permission checks |\n198\t| `PATCH /api/announcements/:id` | author, ADMIN | Audience edits after publish do not re-notify |\n199\t| `POST /api/announcements/:id/archive` | author, ADMIN | |\n200\t| `POST /api/announcements/:id/ack` | in audience | |\n201\t| `POST /api/announcements/preview-audience` | ADMIN, TEACHER | `{ audiences }` → counts by role |\n202\t| `GET /api/announcements/manage` | ADMIN, TEACHER | |\n203\t| `GET /api/announcements/:id/stats` | author, ADMIN | `?format=csv` |\n204\t| `POST /api/announcements/:id/remind` | author, ADMIN | 24h throttle |\n205\t| `GET /api/public/news` | public | Add to `public-routes.ts` |\n206\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"59086f77-7341-496e-add0-8445c854c82b","uuid":"7bd14f08-3901-4f6b-9efb-28ea13b2edc1","timestamp":"2026-11-09T16:32:06.325Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/React Projects/schoolhub/12-announcements.md","content":"### FR-1 Data model\n\n```prisma\nenum AnnouncementStatus { DRAFT SCHEDULED PUBLISHED ARCHIVED }\nenum AudienceType { SCHOOL STAFF ROLE GRADE_LEVEL SECTION COURSE }\n\nmodel Announcement {\n  id                 String             @id @default(cuid())\n  title              String                         // max 150\n  body               String                         // Markdown, max 20,000\n  authorId           String\n  author             User               @relation(fields: [authorId], references: [id])\n  status             AnnouncementStatus @default(DRAFT)\n  publishAt          DateTime?\n  expiresAt          DateTime?                      // hidden from feeds after this\n  pinned             Boolean            @default(false)\n  requiresAck        Boolean            @default(false)\n  isPublic           Boolean            @default(false) // shown on public website news (ADMIN only)\n  coverFileId        String?                         // optional cover image\n  notifiedAt         DateTime?\n  createdAt          DateTime           @default(now())\n  updatedAt          DateTime           @updatedAt\n  audiences          AnnouncementAudience[]\n  attachments        AnnouncementAttachment[]\n  reads              AnnouncementRead[]\n}\n\nmodel AnnouncementAudience {\n  id              String       @id @default(cuid())\n  announcementId  String\n  announcement    Announcement @relation(fields: [announcementId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n  type            AudienceType\n  refId           String?                          // gradeLevelId / sectionId / courseId; role name for ROLE\n  includeStudents Boolean      @default(true)      // for GRADE_LEVEL / SECTION / COURSE\n  includeParents  Boolean      @default(true)\n  includeTeachers Boolean      @default(true)\n}\n\nmodel AnnouncementAttachment {\n  id              String       @id @default(cuid())\n  announcementId  String\n  announcement    Announcement @relation(fields: [announcementId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n  fileId          String\n  file            FileObject   @relation(fields: [fileId], references: [id])\n}\n\nmodel AnnouncementRead {\n  announcementId  String\n  announcement    Announcement @relation(fields: [announcementId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)\n  userId          String\n  readAt          DateTime     @default(now())\n  acknowledgedAt  DateTime?\n  @@id([announcementId, userId])\n}\n```\n\n### FR-2 Audience resolution (`src/server/announcements/audience.ts`)\n1. `resolveAudienceUserIds(audiences)` returns the deduplicated set of ACTIVE, non-archived user ids:\n   - `SCHOOL`: everyone. `STAFF`: ADMIN + TEACHER. `ROLE`: users with role `refId`.\n   - `GRADE_LEVEL`: students whose profile grade level is `refId` (if `includeStudents`), their linked parents (if `includeParents`), teachers of current-year courses in sections of that grade level (if `includeTeachers`).\n   - `SECTION`: section members, their parents, homeroom teacher and teachers of the section's courses (same flags).\n   - `COURSE`: ACTIVE enrolled students, their parents, teacher and co-teachers (same flags).\n2. `isUserInAudience(user, audiences)` answers the same question for one user without loading everyone (used by feeds).\n3. This service is generic and is reused by PRD-14 (calendar events).\n\n### FR-3 Permissions\n1. ADMIN may target any audience and set `isPublic`.\n2. TEACHER may target only COURSE audiences for courses they manage and SECTION audiences for the section they homeroom. `isPublic` is not available.\n3. STUDENT and PARENT cannot create announcements.\n4. Authors may edit their own announcements; admins may edit or archive any.\n\n### FR-4 Composer (`/announcements/new`, `/announcements/[id]/edit`)\n1. Fields: title, body (Markdown editor from PRD-08), cover image (optional), attachments, audience builder (add one or more audience rows: type → entity picker → include students / parents / teachers checkboxes), pinned, requires acknowledgement, public (admins), publish now / schedule (`publishAt`) / save draft, expiry date.\n2. Live recipient count beside the audience builder (\"Will reach 412 people: 180 students, 214 parents, 18 teachers\"), computed by `POST /api/announcements/preview-audience`.\n3. Publishing a body with zero recipients is refused.\n\n### FR-5 Feed (`/announcements`)\n1. All roles: list of published, non-expired announcements whose audience includes the user (scheduled ones appear once `publishAt <= now`, evaluated at read time). Pinned first (maximum 3 pinned shown at top), then newest. Unread items show a dot; filter tabs All / Unread / Requires acknowledgement.\n2. Card: cover image thumbnail, title, author and role, date, audience chips (for example \"Grade 7 · Parents\"), excerpt (200 chars), attachment count.\n3. Detail (`/announcements/[id]`): full body, attachments, \"I acknowledge\" button when required (stores `acknowledgedAt`; button becomes \"Acknowledged on 14 Sep\"). Opening records `readAt`.\n4. Course tab \"Announcements\" shows announcements whose audience includes that course.\n5. Parent feed labels which child each item relates to when audience is grade/section/course-scoped (\"For Sam\").\n\n### FR-6 Author tools\n1. \"Manage\" view (`/announcements/manage`): authored (teachers) or all (admins) announcements with status, audience summary, reach, read %, acknowledged % (when required).\n2. Per-announcement stats page: counts and a recipient table (name, role, read at, acknowledged at) with filters Unread / Not acknowledged, CSV export, and \"Send reminder\" which notifies only those who have not acknowledged (type `announcement.reminder`, maximum one reminder per 24 hours).\n\n### FR-7 Notifications\n1. `announcement.published` (COMMUNICATION, default email true; `mandatoryInApp` true when `requiresAck`). Sent once when the announcement first becomes visible: immediately on publish-now; for scheduled ones by the maintenance run (`publishDueAnnouncements()` sets `notifiedAt`).\n2. Email uses the `generic-notification` template with title, the first 300 characters of body as plain text and a \"Read announcement\" button.\n\n### FR-8 File access & public flag\n1. Register file access `announcement`: users in the audience, the author, admins; plus everyone (public) when the announcement `isPublic` and published.\n2. `getPublicNews({ page })` returns public, published, non-expired announcements for PRD-18.\n\n### FR-9 Navigation\n1. \"Announcements\" for all roles (with unread count badge in the sidebar). TEACHER and ADMIN: \"New announcement\" button on the feed.\n\n## API\n\n| Method & path | Role | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| `GET /api/announcements?tab=&courseId=&page=` | any | Feed for current user |\n| `GET /api/announcements/unread-count` | any | |\n| `GET /api/announcements/:id` | in audience, author, ADMIN | Marks read |\n| `POST /api/announcements` | ADMIN, TEACHER | Audience permission checks |\n| `PATCH /api/announcements/:id` | author, ADMIN | Audience edits after publish do not re-notify |\n| `POST /api/announcements/:id/archive` | author, ADMIN | |\n| `POST /api/announcements/:id/ack` | in audience | |\n| `POST /api/announcements/preview-audience` | ADMIN, TEACHER | `{ audiences }` → counts by role |\n| `GET /api/announcements/manage` | ADMIN, TEACHER | |\n| `GET /api/announcements/:id/stats` | author, ADMIN | `?format=csv` |\n| `POST /api/announcements/:id/remind` | author, ADMIN | 24h throttle |\n| `GET /api/public/news` | public | Add to `public-routes.ts` |\n","numLines":115,"startLine":92,"totalLines":233}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01NBVf6ACURUg5ZeVLFrsMeX","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
