{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgsk6zJHxeufReAZuHZfa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've written the system design for SH-13 to `artifacts/architect/system-design.md`. It covers all 43 requirements (32 functional, 11 non-functional), and a script check confirmed every requirement ID it cites exists in `requirements.json`.\n\nIt builds on the two research documents and needs no new dependencies:\n- **Data:** eight new Prisma models plus a safeguarding-lead flag on `User`, all in one migration.\n- **Messaging rules:** one shared module decides who may message whom. Creating a conversation, sending, and the contacts list all use it.\n- **Delivery:** polling only — every 5 seconds for the open thread, 30 seconds for the inbox and the sidebar badge.\n- **Email:** sent only when a message is still unread after 10 minutes, held until the recipient's quiet hours end, and run by the existing maintenance job.\n- **Safeguarding:** restricted to admins with the safeguarding-lead flag, re-read from the database on each request, with every view logged to the audit log.\n\nWhere the research documents disagreed, I picked one answer and recorded it in a table in the Overview:\n- **Email without an in-app notification:** I added an optional `inApp` flag to the existing `notify()` function, rather than a separate email helper.\n- **`updatedAt` on attachments:** added, following the stack decisions.\n- **Quiet-hours input:** a plain MUI time field, not the date-pickers `TimePicker`.\n\n**Gaps you should know about (none of them blocks this phase):**\n- **No form for the safeguarding-lead flag.** There is no admin page that edits users, so the flag can only be set through `PATCH /api/users/:id` or the seed data.\n- **mui-mcp still needs checking.** The research steps couldn't reach it. I didn't check it either. The dev phase must look up every MUI component through it before writing UI.\n- **New student layout.** `/students/[id]` has no page or layout today, so the \"Message parents\" / \"Message teacher\" actions need a new `layout.tsx` there.\n\n`api-contracts.json` and `handoff-to-dev-planning.json` in that folder are still from SH-12. The `arch-api-contracts` sub-task needs to rewrite them; the endpoint table in section 3.3 is its input."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":349,"cache_read_input_tokens":77365,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":349},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5f2dd57a-95b5-4614-9b2d-795cabd61e18","uuid":"1aa14597-ceda-4001-96e8-aec06d11d747","timestamp":"2026-11-09T17:24:57.543Z","request_id":"req_011Cgsk6z3RKLR4bkgHzW9MZ"}
