{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BkYa7QbuGgouq65LtwrWQC","type":"tool_result","content":"96:enum AudienceType { SCHOOL STAFF ROLE GRADE_LEVEL SECTION COURSE }\n123:  type            AudienceType\n124:  refId           String?                          // gradeLevelId / sectionId / courseId; role name for ROLE\n125:  includeStudents Boolean      @default(true)      // for GRADE_LEVEL / SECTION / COURSE\n148:### FR-2 Audience resolution (`src/server/announcements/audience.ts`)\n149:1. `resolveAudienceUserIds(audiences)` returns the deduplicated set of ACTIVE, non-archived user ids:\n150:   - `SCHOOL`: everyone. `STAFF`: ADMIN + TEACHER. `ROLE`: users with role `refId`.\n151:   - `GRADE_LEVEL`: students whose profile grade level is `refId` (if `includeStudents`), their linked parents (if `includeParents`), teachers of current-year courses in sections of that grade level (if `includeTeachers`).\n154:2. `isUserInAudience(user, audiences)` answers the same question for one user without loading everyone (used by feeds).\n227:- Integration: `isUserInAudience` matches `resolveAudienceUserIds` for every seed user (property-style loop), scheduled publish notification idempotency.\n232:- 6 announcements: school-wide welcome (pinned, public), Grade 7 parents field-trip consent (requires ack), MATH-7A homework club (Tom), staff meeting (STAFF), scheduled sports day notice (publishes in 2 days, public), expired exam timetable notice.\n---\n97:### FR-1 Data model\n98-\n99-```prisma\n100-enum EventCategory { HOLIDAY TERM_BREAK EXAM EVENT MEETING TRIP SPORTS DEADLINE OTHER }\n101-enum Recurrence { NONE WEEKLY MONTHLY }\n102-enum RsvpResponse { YES NO MAYBE }\n103-\n104-model CalendarEvent {\n105-  id            String        @id @default(cuid())\n106-  title         String                        // max 150\n107-  description   String?                       // Markdown, max 5,000\n108-  category      EventCategory\n109-  startAt       DateTime\