{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QVNnTMTaXWrTGidRaYECBT","type":"tool_result","content":"/**\n * Single producer entry point (FR-6..11). Writes in-app rows and enqueues\n * emails per resolved preferences. NEVER throws — failures are logged.\n * Call after your transaction commits.\n */\nexport async function notify(input: NotifyInput): Promise<void> {\n  try {\n    const def = NOTIFICATION_TYPES[input.type];\n    const userIds = [...new Set(input.userIds)];\n    if (!def || userIds.length === 0) return;\n\n    const title = truncate(input.title, TITLE_MAX, 'title', input.type);\n    const body = input.body == null ? null : truncate(input.body, BODY_MAX, 'body', input.type);\n    let link: string | null = input.link ?? null;\n    if (link !== null && !isSafeRelativeLink(link)) {\n      logger.warn('Notification link dropped (not a safe relative path)', { type: input.type });\n      link = null;\n    }\n\n    const [users, prefRows] = await Promise.all([\n      prisma.user.findMany({\n        where: { id: { in: userIds }, status: { notIn: ['DISABLED', 'ARCHIVED'] }, archivedAt: null },\n        select: { id: true, email: true, firstName: true },\n      }),\n      prisma.notificationPreference.findMany({ where: { userId: { in: userIds }, type: input.type } }),\n    ]);\n    const prefByUser = new Map(prefRows.map((r) => [r.userId, r]));\n\n    const inAppIds: string[] = [];\n    const emailTo: { email: string; firstName: string }[] = [];\n    for (const user of users) {\n      const prefs = resolvePrefs(def, prefByUser.get(user.id));\n      if (prefs.inApp && input.inApp !== false) inAppIds.push(user.id);\n      if (prefs.email && input.email && user.email) emailTo.push(user);\n    }\n\n    if (inAppIds.length) {\n      await prisma.notification.createMany({\n        data: inAppIds.map((userId) => ({ userId, type: input.type, title, body, link })),\n      });\n    }\n\n150:model CalendarFeedToken {\n151-  userId     String   @id\n152-  tokenHash  String   @unique\n153-  createdAt  DateTime @default(now())\n154-}\n155-```\n156-\n157-### FR-2 Permissions\n158-1. ADMIN: create any event with any audience; `isNoSchool`, `isPublic` and categories HOLIDAY / TERM_BREAK are admin-only.\n117:  rsvpEnabled   Boolean       @default(false)\n118:  rsvpDeadline  DateTime?\n124:  rsvps         EventRsvp[]\n144:  guests      Int           @default(0)      // 0–5\n180:1. When enabled, audience members choose Yes / No / Maybe with guest count (parents) and optional note until `rsvpDeadline`. The event drawer shows the user's response and totals (for creator/admin: full list with CSV export).\n181:2. Register `event.rsvp_reminder`: 48 hours before the deadline, the maintenance run notifies audience members who have not responded (once per event).\n204:| `PUT /api/events/:id/rsvp` | audience | `{ response, guests, note }`, before deadline |\n205:| `GET /api/events/:id/rsvps` | creator, ADMIN | `?format=csv` |\nprisma/schema.prisma:77:  studentProfile           StudentProfile?\nprisma/schema.prisma:121:  gradeLevelId     String\nprisma/schema.prisma:122:  gradeLevel       GradeLevel @relation(fields: [gradeLevelId], references: [id])\nprisma/schema.prisma:275:  studentProfiles StudentProfile[]\nprisma/schema.prisma:390:  gradeLevelId       String","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aebc8821-7772-4638-b1aa-c18e63e97e7e","uuid":"116b7cfb-4ff6-4399-ae59-12feca953f44","timestamp":"2026-11-09T18:51:09.941Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"/**\n * Single producer entry point (FR-6..11). Writes in-app rows and enqueues\n * emails per resolved preferences. NEVER throws — failures are logged.\n * Call after your transaction commits.\n */\nexport async function notify(input: NotifyInput): Promise<void> {\n  try {\n    const def = NOTIFICATION_TYPES[input.type];\n    const userIds = [...new Set(input.userIds)];\n    if (!def || userIds.length === 0) return;\n\n    const title = truncate(input.title, TITLE_MAX, 'title', input.type);\n    const body = input.body == null ? null : truncate(input.body, BODY_MAX, 'body', input.type);\n    let link: string | null = input.link ?? null;\n    if (link !== null && !isSafeRelativeLink(link)) {\n      logger.warn('Notification link dropped (not a safe relative path)', { type: input.type });\n      link = null;\n    }\n\n    const [users, prefRows] = await Promise.all([\n      prisma.user.findMany({\n        where: { id: { in: userIds }, status: { notIn: ['DISABLED', 'ARCHIVED'] }, archivedAt: null },\n        select: { id: true, email: true, firstName: true },\n      }),\n      prisma.notificationPreference.findMany({ where: { userId: { in: userIds }, type: input.type } }),\n    ]);\n    const prefByUser = new Map(prefRows.map((r) => [r.userId, r]));\n\n    const inAppIds: string[] = [];\n    const emailTo: { email: string; firstName: string }[] = [];\n    for (const user of users) {\n      const prefs = resolvePrefs(def, prefByUser.get(user.id));\n      if (prefs.inApp && input.inApp !== false) inAppIds.push(user.id);\n      if (prefs.email && input.email && user.email) emailTo.push(user);\n    }\n\n    if (inAppIds.length) {\n      await prisma.notification.createMany({\n        data: inAppIds.map((userId) => ({ userId, type: input.type, title, body, link })),\n      });\n    }\n\n150:model CalendarFeedToken {\n151-  userId     String   @id\n152-  tokenHash  String   @unique\n153-  createdAt  DateTime @default(now())\n154-}\n155-```\n156-\n157-### FR-2 Permissions\n158-1. ADMIN: create any event with any audience; `isNoSchool`, `isPublic` and categories HOLIDAY / TERM_BREAK are admin-only.\n117:  rsvpEnabled   Boolean       @default(false)\n118:  rsvpDeadline  DateTime?\n124:  rsvps         EventRsvp[]\n144:  guests      Int           @default(0)      // 0–5\n180:1. When enabled, audience members choose Yes / No / Maybe with guest count (parents) and optional note until `rsvpDeadline`. The event drawer shows the user's response and totals (for creator/admin: full list with CSV export).\n181:2. Register `event.rsvp_reminder`: 48 hours before the deadline, the maintenance run notifies audience members who have not responded (once per event).\n204:| `PUT /api/events/:id/rsvp` | audience | `{ response, guests, note }`, before deadline |\n205:| `GET /api/events/:id/rsvps` | creator, ADMIN | `?format=csv` |\nprisma/schema.prisma:77:  studentProfile           StudentProfile?\nprisma/schema.prisma:121:  gradeLevelId     String\nprisma/schema.prisma:122:  gradeLevel       GradeLevel @relation(fields: [gradeLevelId], references: [id])\nprisma/schema.prisma:275:  studentProfiles StudentProfile[]\nprisma/schema.prisma:390:  gradeLevelId       String","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01QVNnTMTaXWrTGidRaYECBT","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
