{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgsrruo6QS6jeFGnUueb1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01ThKvrFeoXcDYEmx5u5Zr2o","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/ikramaansari/Documents/React Projects/schoolhub/artifacts/architect/system-design.md","old_string":"| `src/server/calendar/calendar-service.ts` (new) | `getCalendarItems`, `getEvent`, `createEvent`, `updateEvent`, `deleteEvent`, `upsertRsvp`, `listRsvps`, `isSchoolDay`, `noSchoolDays(from,to)`, `createTermBreaks(yearId, actor)`, `getPublicEvents`, `getUpcomingEventsForUser`, `getOrCreateFeedToken`, `resetFeedToken`, `findUserByFeedToken` | Owns every per-entity check (NFR-7). **Imports nothing from timetable-service** (R2). It reads `prisma.schoolDay` directly, and timetable-service imports *from* it. | FR-5..8, FR-15..16, FR-20..23, FR-25..26, FR-28..34, FR-36 |","new_string":"| `src/server/calendar/calendar-service.ts` (new) | `getEvent`, `createEvent`, `updateEvent`, `deleteEvent`, `upsertRsvp`, `listRsvps`, `isSchoolDay`, `noSchoolDays(from,to)`, `createTermBreaks(yearId, actor)`, `getOrCreateFeedToken`, `resetFeedToken`, `findUserByFeedToken` | Owns every per-entity check (NFR-7). **Imports nothing from timetable-service** (R2). It reads `prisma.schoolDay` directly, and timetable-service imports *from* it. | FR-5..8, FR-16, FR-20..23, FR-25, FR-33, FR-34, FR-36 |\n| `src/server/calendar/sources.ts` (new) | `getCalendarItems`, `getPublicEvents`, `getUpcomingEventsForUser` | The merge in §3.1. It may import timetable-service, the assignment and quiz services, and calendar-service, because nothing imports it back except routes (R2). | FR-10, FR-11, FR-15, FR-26, FR-30..32 |"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16730,"cache_read_input_tokens":65082,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input